metadata:
  analysis_version: 1.0.0
  source_count: 11
  coordinate_unit: px
  source_notes[6]: "Sources 0-5 are the kit's six reference images in ycoding-office-repair-kit/references/images (01 shell, 02 reported-problem render, 03 effort popover, 04 sidebar crop, 05 composer crop, 06 settings).","Source 6 is /Users/viadz/Documents/SCR-20260915-sjsf.png, supplied explicitly for the office look; it is NOT part of the kit reference set and must not be copied into the kit as an asset.","The explicit SCR-20260916-ghfd.png sidebar crop and SCR-20260916-gheb.png composer crop are byte-identical to kit sources 3 and 4 (sha256 4608a8ad7145f52709c238782ae9f0f7e88fb0f3070092fa575d0442802563ff and 6a1ed8c7d0a33b58065232fa4b3aae0cfb19b250ed0f9ec8d4ff7ab59ed2bc42), so they are the same sources and are not duplicated.","Sources 7-10 are the newest kit evidence captures: r2-04 office, r7-03 statistics, r7-09 analytics and r7-04 quota.","The provider-usage card composition was supplied as a parent description of an inline image that is not available to this session; it is recorded as supplied-parent-description, not direct inspection. The description states: a narrow light card titled Total Spend with an export icon; segmented Today / Yesterday / 30 Days; a donut with the total centred and a provider colour legend with right-aligned monetary values; below that a separate provider header then quota window rows (Session / Weekly / model-specific) with horizontal remaining bars, percent on the left and a reset countdown; some estimated-at-reset markers; expandable daily spend/token rows. It is a composition reference adaptable to the dark theme, not branding, data or permission to fabricate forecasts.","No screenshot-derived artwork, font binary or third-party asset may be extracted from these images; this analysis is measurement only."
  redactions_applied: true
screens[11]:
  - id: screen-ref01-app-shell
    name: Reference app shell
    width: 2048
    height: 1306
    background: "#181818"
    layout_model: grid
    source_index: 0
    state: default
    viewport_class: desktop
    scroll_direction: none
    confidence: 0.95
    evidence: "Source references/images/01-app-shell-reference.png (2048x1306). Sidebar, header, content, inspector overlay, status banner and composer are all directly visible."
  - id: screen-ref02-current-problem
    name: Current YCoding render (reported problem)
    width: 1600
    height: 900
    background: "#C8C5BD"
    layout_model: overlay
    source_index: 1
    state: reported_problem
    viewport_class: desktop
    scroll_direction: vertical
    confidence: 0.9
    evidence: Source references/images/02-current-ycoding-problem.png (1600x900). Opaque light sidebar and composer cards overlay the pixel office; content is clipped at the right edge.
  - id: screen-ref03-effort-popover
    name: Effort popover
    width: 532
    height: 208
    background: "#181818"
    layout_model: absolute
    source_index: 2
    state: default
    viewport_class: popover
    scroll_direction: none
    confidence: 0.85
    evidence: "Source references/images/03-model-effort-reference.png (532x208). Rounded popover with a title, secondary label and a horizontal effort track."
  - id: screen-ref04-sidebar
    name: Sidebar crop
    width: 562
    height: 1576
    background: "#372C30"
    layout_model: flex
    source_index: 3
    state: default
    viewport_class: sidebar-crop
    scroll_direction: vertical
    confidence: 0.88
    evidence: Source references/images/04-sidebar-reference.png (562x1576). Same sidebar as the shell reference at a larger crop scale.
  - id: screen-ref05-composer
    name: Composer crop
    width: 1516
    height: 230
    background: "#181818"
    layout_model: flex
    source_index: 4
    state: empty
    viewport_class: composer-crop
    scroll_direction: none
    confidence: 0.9
    evidence: Source references/images/05-composer-reference.png (1516x230). Composer card with a placeholder row and a lower action row.
  - id: screen-ref06-settings
    name: Settings
    width: 2048
    height: 1289
    background: "#181818"
    layout_model: grid
    source_index: 5
    state: default
    viewport_class: desktop
    scroll_direction: vertical
    confidence: 0.92
    evidence: "Source references/images/06-settings-reference.png (2048x1289). Settings navigation, search field, page title, grouped cards and rows are directly visible."
  - id: screen-ref07-gather-office
    name: Gather-style pixel office
    width: 1750
    height: 1686
    background: "#ECE4DB"
    layout_model: grid
    source_index: 6
    state: default
    viewport_class: office-map
    scroll_direction: both
    confidence: 0.9
    evidence: "Source /Users/viadz/Documents/SCR-20260915-sjsf.png (1750x1686), supplied explicitly for the office look. Multi-room floor plan with corridors, desk banks, planted lounges and character sprites."
  - id: screen-cur-office
    name: Current office shell
    width: 1280
    height: 720
    background: "#22252E"
    layout_model: grid
    source_index: 7
    state: idle
    viewport_class: desktop
    scroll_direction: none
    confidence: 0.95
    evidence: Source evidence/r2-04/r2-04-office.png (1280x720). Newest captured office-first shell in the kit evidence set.
  - id: screen-cur-statistics-report
    name: Current statistics report state
    width: 1280
    height: 720
    background: "#1D1E21"
    layout_model: flow
    source_index: 8
    state: report
    viewport_class: desktop
    scroll_direction: vertical
    confidence: 0.9
    evidence: "Source evidence/r7-03/r7-03-statistics.png (1280x720). Flat metric report; no chart, card, segmented control or heatmap is rendered."
  - id: screen-cur-statistics-actions
    name: Current statistics action state
    width: 1280
    height: 720
    background: "#1D1E21"
    layout_model: flow
    source_index: 9
    state: actions
    viewport_class: desktop
    scroll_direction: vertical
    confidence: 0.9
    evidence: Source evidence/r7-09/r7-09-analytics.png (1280x720). Adds two segmented chips and one outlined action button above the same flat metric list.
  - id: screen-cur-quota
    name: Current provider quota state
    width: 1280
    height: 720
    background: "#1D1E21"
    layout_model: flow
    source_index: 10
    state: quota
    viewport_class: desktop
    scroll_direction: vertical
    confidence: 0.9
    evidence: Source evidence/r7-04/r7-04-quota.png (1280x720). Provider groups and quota window rows are plain text lines.
